Subject: [PATCH 2/5] chore: point channel defaults at Engineering Physics and
 tighten env templates

- replace the remaining Power Codex strings in run.py, core/script_engine.py and
  both env templates with Engineering Physics (description, category playlists,
  SEO title suffix and tags)
- drop the paid ElevenLabs option from the templates; the zero-cost policy only
  allows edge-tts, Chatterbox and the self-hosted Chatterbox HTTP engine
- document the footage provider keys the workflows already read
  (COVERR, DVIDS, EUROPEANA, NARA, NASA)
